From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 15:35:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(prod): close sync races, RBAC gaps, and metric
 integrity bugs

Hold Postgres advisory locks on dedicated pool connections so multi-instance
syncs cannot orphan or ignore locks. Stop false-failing healthy long backfills,
never mark lock contention as FAILED, and require password re-auth for account
deletion. Gate env Meta tokens to platform admins in production, pick (not sum)
overlapping purchase/lead actions, align conversions with dashboard math, add
Meta request timeouts, encrypt OAuth session tokens at rest, and fix chart
timezone / empty KPI fallback UX.
